        "original_id": "81970032-b15f-50fc-a8b0-0161d7df9e32",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S. Shankar, S.P. Venkatesh, K. T. Kunjumon\n- Films: Gentleman, Punjabi House\n- Songs: Chikku Bukku Rayile, Style\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer, director\n- Awards: Filmfare Best Director Award, Tamil Nadu State Film Award for Best Director\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" was a Tamil song featured in the film \"Gentleman\".\n- In 1993, S. Shankar made his directorial debut with \"Gentleman\", which was produced by K. T. Kunjumon.\n- For \"Gentleman\", S. Shankar received the Filmfare Best Director Award and the Tamil Nadu State Film Award for Best Director.\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer.\n- Suresh Peters performed notable songs including \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\" and \"Style\".\n- In \"Punjabi House\", Suresh Peters composed the songs in his debut as a film composer, while S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
